{"id":"4019455354006055577","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"一到高雄就見到滿滿的藤井風好開心ᴗ̥̥ .̼ ᴗ̥♡⸝⸝！好喜歡高雄哇，吃到的每樣食物都好好吃！晚上去港邊吹海風散步太幸福了🥰！演唱會真的就快到了嗎嗚嗚嗚，超級期待😭💖💖💖\n\n（拍紅綠燈沒有雜線的小技巧：錄影設定調 60fps▓）\n\n𝗙𝘂𝗷𝗶𝗶 𝗞𝗮𝘇𝗲 ²⁰²⁶·¹⁰·³¹\n𝗣𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗮 𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗹𝗱 𝗧𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗞𝗮𝗼𝗵𝘀𝗶𝘂𝗻𝗴","username":"evil.faucet","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@evil.faucet/post/DfH-Vk2EqqZ","timestamp":"2026-10-30T16:07:18Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-30T20:32:21.561380956Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-30T20:32:46.627409Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-30T20:32:46.627409Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_fa75ab9f4b822658","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
